    narr:narration """On July 15, 2026, Quinton Fairweather formalized the [adoption of Zypherion](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1) as the organization's new analytics database. The decision is grounded in a [performance-based justification](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2), citing a 15x speed improvement for columnar queries over existing infrastructure. This shift is presented as a [definitive technical transition](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4) with [quantifiable efficiency gains](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5). The execution plan is set to [commence in Q3 2026](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6), moving from an initial general intent to [start next quarter](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3) to a specific calendar commitment.""" ;
